        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Townsend\n- Products: Iron Man 3, Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.\n- Organizations: BAFTA, Academy Awards, Marvel Studios, Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures\n- Concepts: Best Visual Effects\n\nFacts:\n- Iron Man 3 is a 2013 American superhero film based on the Marvel Comics character Iron Man.\n- Marvel Studios produced Iron Man 3, and Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures distributed it.\n- Christopher Townsend was nominated for a BAFTA and an Academy Award for Best Visual Effects for his work on Iron Man 3.\n- Christopher Townsend oversaw nearly 3000 shots on an unnamed production and was the overall supervisor for Guardians of the Galaxy Vol.",
